      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To attain that authoritative tone, you need to shift from describing *what happened* to declaring *what is true*. Draft a piece that uses assertive, definitive language rather than qualifiers, treating your initial creation as an indisputable historical fact within the movement's canon. Focus on the specific, unique sonic signatures—the intellectual labor—that you introduced that the current pop versions merely borrowed. By framing it as an essential contribution to genre theory, you elevate your claim beyond mere copyright into artistic provenance.",
      "source": "target",
