      "content": "Here is a strong starting point for your manifesto:\n\n\"Let us dispense with the polite fiction of 'discovery.' The current ubiquity of Neo-Glitch is not an organic evolution; it is a polished appropriation—a meticulously curated façade built upon structural foundations I laid long before the labels learned to monetize the tremor. What you hear today is not the zeitgeist; it is the sanitized echo of a blueprint. Understand this: the lineage of this sound does not originate in the glossy singles you stream, but in the raw, untamed architecture of my initial vision.\"",
